 sexual bias in the population settlement of La Reunion Island (Indian Ocean)</article-title><source>American journal of physical anthropology</source><year>2008</year><volume>136</volume><issue>1</issue><fpage>100</fpage><lpage>107</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1002/ajpa.20783</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18186507</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B15"><mixed-citation publication-type="book"><name><surname>Sambrook</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Fritsch</surname><given-names>EF</given-names></name><name><surname>Maniatis</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><source>Molecular cloning. A laboratory manual.</source><year>1989</year><edition>Second</edition><publisher-name>New York , Cold Spring Harbor Laboratory Press</publisher-name></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B16"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Vigilant</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Pennington</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Harpending</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Kocher</surname><given-names>TD</given-names></name><name><surname>Wilson</surname><given-names>AC</given-names></name><article-title>Mitochondrial DNA sequences in single hairs from a southern African population</article-title><source>Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences of the United States of America</source><year>1989</year><volume>86</volume><issue>23</issue><fpage>9350</fpage><lpage>9354</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1073/pnas.86.23.9350</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2594772</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B17"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Mateu</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Comas</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Calafell</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Perez-Lezaun</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Abade</surname><given